flowchart LR
  SOURCE[Untrusted archive] --> LIMITS[Size and path limits]
  LIMITS --> PARSE[Inert parsing]
  PARSE --> CONVERT[Versioned conversion]
  CONVERT --> PREVIEW[Warnings and preview]
  PREVIEW --> STAGE[(Staging workspace)]
  STAGE --> VERIFY[Links, IDs, and hashes]
  VERIFY -->|commit| NEW[(New workspace)]
  VERIFY -->|failure| ROLLBACK[Discard staging]
